{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1723161600, "end_date": 1723766399, "month_true_total": 1980, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:27:26 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "172198955", "author": {"steamid": "76561199254761510", "personaname": "Wick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199254761510/", "num_games_owned": 48, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 37822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6897, "last_played": 1786569615, "avatar": "66e0ed99ac129c276fe7236511788d30a355c368"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "身为冻肉的我有权发言：刚开始玩这个游戏的时候被怪追着跑还能反打的我很开心，现在，我甚至不用被怪追着跑就已经开始了俯冲，从头到尾最少要有一个点能让玩家爽到才能算是PVE，现在一个点都不让爽我觉得这应该是EVPVE。自由冻肉喂自由大虫版本！！！玩家的自由=削弱枪械+支援CD干瞪眼，虫子的自由=密集刷新的大怪+电磁场环境不让放支援技能。来来回回能用的武器一只手数都有点多余，虫山虫海的大型怪扑面而来，恨不得带四个红色支援，在搭配方面这个版本不需要用脑子想都知道带啥都是挨打，仓库一堆枪落灰（难道是想出个展柜让我们看看你那该死的模型吗？）。武器开镜瞄准放大的居然是该死的瞄具，而不是敌人，吐酸泰坦的头比我的屌都小，怎么打都打不坏；因为自由升级的是敌人，所以不给你爽。对本来就打不动的怪，枪械要么削弱了几个弹夹，要么打不死怪，还有那可笑的突击步枪，我都不好意思带出门，队友看到了还以为这是个傻子。平衡所有的武器不是一件坏事，但冻肉们不喜欢拿着烧火棍帮虫子烧火吃熟肉。不是在被虫子追的路上，就是喂虫子的路上。这个游戏我认为应该有个响亮的名字：超级绝地俯冲之自由冻肉！", "timestamp_created": 1723753392, "timestamp_updated": 1723753392, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 36, "votes_funny": 24, "weighted_vote_score": "0.713718950748443604", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "172193852", "author": {"steamid": "76561198957054727", "personaname": "白给少年", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zhangwenbo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 831, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 510, "last_played": 1748793841, "avatar": "acacec54c2cb39d998efbca9d09aa8295300b935"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "虫子是你爹！机器人是你🐎！\n你们就是傻逼中的战斗机，弱智里的NO.1,\n操老婆阳痿连机炮都要贷款分24期的脑瘫策划平衡，\npve游戏干成这逼样，老子是来爽的，你们这帮大傻逼加强泥马勒戈壁的怪，\n纯尼玛一帮畜生全部拉出去诛九族都没有一个冤枉的，现在更新完后就是游戏诈骗，\nS玩家被虫子爹机器妈打成M，\n你们这帮没有道德的孽畜，还削弱玩家武器，逼样的怎么不拿刀削弱你们的小鸡鸡呢？\n自己鸡巴有问题还几把给老婆灌春药，买个漏电的超大机炮还觉得自己好厉害\n你爹当初就该把你们射在墙上而不是射在你们🐎的逼里！", "timestamp_created": 1723748553, "timestamp_updated": 1723748727, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.568609058856964111", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172191616", "author": {"steamid": "76561198324045469", "personaname": "Roland", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198324045469/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 57841, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2922, "playtime_at_review": 15742, "last_played": 1788067352, "avatar": "5f361d848806ba596b642b45501311c4b98e6273"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这个游戏体验，好比买了车票坐一半就被司机踹下车，坐的太舒服被司机叫起来不准坐，还要往车上的瘸子的好腿上猛踹。好路不走偏要走烂路，完事还要来一句你在教我开车？爱坐不坐，不坐退钱滚蛋。看来车上的活人还是太多了。\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1723746402, "timestamp_updated": 1723746402, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54083937406539917", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172186351", "author": {"steamid": "76561198376594934", "personaname": "十年口子窖", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198376594934/", "num_games_owned": 201, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 5016, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 246, "playtime_at_review": 2431, "last_played": 1787399568, "avatar": "d7b7988e7bc32f8e08ab167acd110bf8783e59af"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "滚尼吗的垃圾游戏 我他妈是来打虫子爽的 不是让你升级的怪他妈打的飞来飞去的 去死吧", "timestamp_created": 1723741245, "timestamp_updated": 1723741245, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172184208", "author": {"steamid": "76561199632824312", "personaname": "星星之火可以燎原", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199632824312/", "num_games_owned": 157, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 24822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 108, "playtime_at_review": 14193, "last_played": 1787065316, "avatar": "ffc06397744cc94e908766d13978e684f122bcb8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "超级地球是投注", "timestamp_created": 1723739103, "timestamp_updated": 1756505022, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522237658500671387", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "172183962", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165576025", "personaname": "Naux", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165576025/", "num_games_owned": 198, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 4827, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3200, "last_played": 1770288230, "avatar": "d5600f93c830be2024aa5ff077a4edc713cc7e3d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "BAD", "timestamp_created": 1723738856, "timestamp_updated": 1723738856, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free"